        "question": "'The discovery of DNA was the most significant breakthrough in understanding the causes of illness in the period c1900-present.' How far do you agree? Explain your answer. (16 marks) You may use the following in your answer:<br>• Watson and Crick<br>• Lifestyle factors<br>You must also use information of your own.",
